{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-04-28 18:01:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT - LABATON SUCHAROW INVESTIGATING AMAZON.COM INC. – AMZN', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LABATON SUCHAROW, A NATIONALLY RANKED AND AWARD-WINNING SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING AMAZON.COM INC. ("AMAZON" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: AMZN) FOR POTENTIAL VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. AMAZON SHARES DROPPED AS MUCH AS 10% IN EXTENDED TRADING ON THURSDAY, APRIL 28, 2022 AFTER THE COMPANY ISSUED A REVENUE FORECAST THAT TRAILED ANALYSTS\' ESTIMATES. AMAZON SAID IT HAD A NET LOSS OF $3.8 BILLION IN THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH'}